n$$\nF(x,y,z)=⟨x,\\,y,\\,xz⟩,\\,r(u,v)=⟨u,\\,{v}^{2},\\,uv⟩,\\,(u,v)\\in D⊂{R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nIf the flux of $F$ across $S$ with respect to $n$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}a{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+bu{v}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $a+b?$"] ["question-8e8e30b7-68c9-50ac-bfbf-42853c6a4c1f" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}({v}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,v⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}({v}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2v,\\,u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & v \\\\ 0 & 2v & u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & v \\\\ 2v & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}1 & v \\\\ 0 & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2v\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-u,\\,2v⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =⟨x,\\,y,\\,xz⟩{|}_{x=u\\,y={v}^{2}\\,z=uv} \\\\  & =⟨u,\\,{v}^{2},\\,{u}^{2}v⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨u,\\,{v}^{2},\\,{u}^{2}v⟩\\cdot ⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-u,\\,2v⟩ \\\\  & =u\\cdot (-2{v}^{2})+{v}^{2}\\cdot (-u)+{u}^{2}v\\cdot 2v \\\\  & =-2u{v}^{2}-u{v}^{2}+2{u}^{2}{v}^{2} \\\\  & =2{u}^{2}{v}^{2}-3u{v}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2\\cdot {u}^{2}{v}^{2}+(-3)\\cdot u{v}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\na+b=2-3=-1.\n$$"] ["question-8e8e30b7-68c9-50ac-bfbf-42853c6a4c1f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-63772144-9630-582a-8d79-f08320bc64ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "63772144-9630-582a-8d79-f08320bc64ad"] ["answer-67d2eb68-0652-5e48-b001-a45c2700c7e4" :answer/id #uuid "67d2eb68-0652-5e48-b001-a45c2700c7e4"] ["answer-67d2eb68-0652-5e48-b001-a45c2700c7e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-67d2eb68-0652-5e48-b001-a45c2700c7e4" :answer/value "-1"] ["answer-c199e1eb-7983-554d-81aa-b675e5252dbd" :answer/id #uuid "c199e1eb-7983-554d-81aa-b675e5252dbd"] ["answer-c199e1eb-7983-554d-81aa-b675e5252dbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c199e1eb-7983-554d-81aa-b675e5252dbd" :answer/value "-2"] ["answer-e8394076-ef1d-5d29-b139-67414f969f56" :answer/id #uuid "e8394076-ef1d-5d29-b139-67414f969f56"] ["answer-e8394076-ef1d-5d29-b139-67414f969f56" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e8394076-ef1d-5d29-b139-67414f969f56" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-94798f5c-574c-53cd-bb0e-eb9396410fae" :answer/id #uuid "94798f5c-574c-53cd-bb0e-eb9396410fae"] ["answer-94798f5c-574c-53cd-bb0e-eb9396410fae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-94798f5c-574c-53cd-bb0e-eb9396410fae" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-ee167035-8819-5d49-80a8-31c9bebffaab" :answer/id #uuid "ee167035-8819-5d49-80a8-31c9bebffaab"] ["answer-ee167035-8819-5d49-80a8-31c9bebffaab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ee167035-8819-5d49-80a8-31c9bebffaab" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-63772144-9630-582a-8d79-f08320bc64ad" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-63772144-9630-582a-8d79-f08320bc64ad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-63772144-